# vendor/ and public/build/ ARE committed on purpose: Hostinger's GitHub deploy only copies
# what is in the repo and runs no composer/npm. Rebuild them (composer install, npm run build)
# and commit before deploying a release. Real secrets never go in git:
# .env (already ignored above) is created by hand on the server.
